  "description": "meme-id: i_like_to_play_outside; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows a young child with a wide, happy smile, standing outdoors in a sunny, green environment, with the text 'i like to play outside' overlaid. The scene is innocent and positive, evoking a sense of childhood joy and freedom. There is no toxicity present in the image. The meme's intent is to convey a simple, wholesome message about enjoying outdoor play, using the child's genuine expression to reinforce the sentiment. The juxtaposition of the text with the image creates an analogical mapping that emphasizes the natural, carefree pleasure of being outside. The meme is not abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic. It is a lighthearted, positive expression of a universal childhood experience.",
